% Vocative NPs explicitly mark the addressee without filling a semantic role;
% the 'addressee' relation links the NP instance to the situation of the rest
% of the sentence.
%
% ERS fingerprint (https://delph-in.github.io/docs/erg/ErgSemantics_Vocatives/):
%   addressee[ARG1 x, ARG2 e]

pattern { A [pred="addressee"]; A -[1=ARG1]-> X; A -[1=ARG2]-> E }
